### ==============================================================
### Test Error Boundary Flow - HTTP Test File
### ==============================================================
### Her transition organik olarak farklı bir statusCode üretir:
###   trigger-409 → StartTask + fixed key → 409 Conflict  → Ignore
###   trigger-404 → GetInstanceData + dead UUID → 404 NotFound → Ignore
###   trigger-400 → StartTask + empty body → 400 Validation → Ignore
###   trigger-500 → DirectTrigger + nil UUID → 500 Failure  → Ignore / Abort→error-sink
###
### Debug için MapLocalResultToInvocationResult'a breakpoint koy ve
### TaskExecutionEngine'deki errorCode match mantığını adım adım izle.
### ==============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4201
@apiVersion = 1
@domain = core
@workflow = test-error-boundary-flow
@instanceKey = eb-flow-test-{{$timestamp}}

### ==============================================================
### STEP 1: Start instance → idle state
### ==============================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "{{instanceKey}}",
  "tags": ["error-boundary-test", "statuscode-test"]
}

### ==============================================================
### STEP 2: Get current state
### ==============================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/functions/state

### ==============================================================
### SCENARIO A: trigger-409 — Conflict
### Önce task-test-subflow "fixed-eb-409-key" ile başlatılmış olmalı.
### İkinci tetiklemede 409 üretilir; Task:409 → Ignore → conflict-handled
### ==============================================================

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/trigger-409
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ==============================================================
### SCENARIO B: trigger-404 — Not Found
### Dead UUID (00000000-dead-beef-...) ile GetInstanceData çağrılır.
### 404 üretilir; Task:404 → Ignore → not-found-handled
### ==============================================================

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/trigger-404
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ==============================================================
### SCENARIO C: trigger-400 — Validation
### account-opening-workflow'a boş body ile StartTask çağrılır.
### 400 üretilir; Task:400 → Ignore → validation-handled
### ==============================================================

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/trigger-400
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ==============================================================
### SCENARIO D: trigger-500 — Failure
### Nil UUID instance üzerinde geçersiz transition tetiklenir.
### 500 üretilir; Task:500 → Ignore (logOnly) → failure-handled
### Eğer Task:500 match etmezse wildcard (*) → Abort → error-sink
### ==============================================================

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/trigger-500
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ==============================================================
### MONITORING: Final instance data
### ==============================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/functions/data
